# rena0-hyper-ex-camera — F1-3 fixture, the Hyper EX attack's action camera
#
# Source: FUN_0043ffc0 case 0x15e (the EX body, move 350) plays the battle camera for the
# whole move and has NO contact test around the request, so it plays on a whiff too — the
# owner confirmed that against the original's own screenshot (V3-37). The set is 5: the owner
# identified it by eye after every set of data/camera/01.x was rendered for this move, so the
# index is a tier-3 observation standing in for a recovered constant, and it is pinned here so
# a future edit cannot quietly change the framing.
#
# The opponent sits 2000 units away, so the EX swing cannot connect: `attack_row 350` and a
# non-zero `action_camera` on the same tick prove the camera is not a hit effect.
combo 0 0
seed 5489
spawn 0 0 0 0
spawn 1 0 0 2000
collision open-field
hyper oyashiro
input 0 SPECIAL
input 1 -
input 20 SPECIAL
input 21 -
expect 0 hyper 1
expect 19 action_camera 0
# The press tick already runs the move's first program update, so the camera arms there.
expect 20 attack_row 350
expect 20 action_camera 5
expect 30 action_camera 5
expect 30 swing_hits 0
